'Independent servo cam, constant HGX drive mesh, native joints and fou
r gear links. Use CompactCam.motion_control.Controller for cam followi
ng and the moving hob''s carrier-relative equation. The fourth native 
gear link applies only at the clamped carrier datum. No opening clutch
 or reverse-extruder opening mode. MG90S nominal case and adjustable m
ounting prototype. Supplied horn/spline envelopes are not manufacturin
g profiles; the retained printed cam drive, loaded torque and durabili
ty remain unqualified. WORK IN PROGRESS / UNTESTED / NOT READY FOR USE.
 Aligned standard-HGX stack is the user''s unqualified mesh experiment
, not a physical gear-mesh certificate. Monolith mount development pro
totype: the 45.4mm stock block exceeds the original overall-width limi
t; no width waiver or print release is claimed.',(#402115));
